Model providers
---------------

vismod ships no model weights and performs no classification itself. All
content detection is performed by the configured provider — Azure AI
Content Safety, Google Cloud Vision SafeSearch, Hive, or a self-hosted
ShieldGemma endpoint — under that provider's own terms and license. See
RESPONSIBLE_USE.md and MODEL_LIMITATIONS.md.
